# 30. CREDENTIAL COMPROMISE

If a credential is compromised:

1. Validate compromise
2. Identify affected account
3. Contain account
4. Revoke sessions/tokens where applicable
5. Reset credential
6. Investigate authentication history
7. Check privilege
8. Investigate lateral movement
9. Enable/improve MFA
10. Monitor

