# ⭐ ONE-LINE EXAM ANSWER

> **Incident response is the structured process of preparing for, detecting, analyzing, containing, eradicating, recovering from, and learning from cybersecurity incidents while preserving appropriate evidence and minimizing business impact.**

# 🔥 DAY 58 GOLDEN RULE

> **Don't just remove the symptom. Contain the incident, preserve evidence, find the root cause, eradicate the threat, recover safely, and improve the defenses so the same incident is less likely to happen again.**